            {
                "entry_id": "2082b8bd-c20c-3571-928d-b5f3c3bd0729",
                "word": "némésis",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4984f347-b9d5-3928-9ad0-7cc8f565116f",
                        "entry_id": "2082b8bd-c20c-3571-928d-b5f3c3bd0729",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Vengeance divine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1448ca54-221b-4b4b-ad4c-0abea234384c",
                                "sense_id": "4984f347-b9d5-3928-9ad0-7cc8f565116f",
                                "text": "Elle illustre, une fois de plus, l’action de la némésis qui punit tout individu échappant à la loi commune : exceptionnel par sa beauté, Narcisse, aimé de tous et de toutes, n’aime personne ; il en sera puni par l’amour le plus extraordinaire qui soit : il tombe amoureux de sa propre image […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd75fb7b-8fc1-4043-b7d8-8a167cea22c1",
                                "sense_id": "4984f347-b9d5-3928-9ad0-7cc8f565116f",
                                "text": "Certaines notions qui lui sont très familières aux siècles classiques — comme celles de l’hybris et de la némésis — se retrouvent chez des populations aussi peu évoluées que les tribus Moïs du sud de l’Indochine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7163e1c-ee2d-4b3d-b34f-6954b32210eb",
                                "sense_id": "4984f347-b9d5-3928-9ad0-7cc8f565116f",
                                "text": "C’est la vieille croyance grecque à la némésis, mais revue et rendue plus morale ; car, pour Eschyle, les dieux ne punissent plus simplement ceux qui s’élèvent trop haut : ils punissent une faute, ils incarnent la justice."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4800c90e-465b-37c2-b151-107d33f946ea",
                        "entry_id": "2082b8bd-c20c-3571-928d-b5f3c3bd0729",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ennemi ultime."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4d0280c1-2e8c-45ba-bd30-9bb0338edf4a",
                        "source_entry_id": "2082b8bd-c20c-3571-928d-b5f3c3bd0729",
                        "target_lang_word": "nemesis",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nemesis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0352eab-e1e1-3665-9818-1e66905bef6e",
                                        "entry_id": "adca1849-d2bb-33d9-aa4b-d9071f8eb8fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An enemy, especially an archenemy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5a4f60d-4395-47de-832a-95530f752b09",
                                                "sense_id": "b0352eab-e1e1-3665-9818-1e66905bef6e",
                                                "text": "Batman is in constant conflict with his nemesis, The Joker."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba59d268-109e-4f22-9c53-a3f9a13b862d",
                                                "sense_id": "b0352eab-e1e1-3665-9818-1e66905bef6e",
                                                "text": "The roofer stayed in touch, committed to the downfall of his nemesis, Mikey. One week after his initial phone call, we were on our way to raid Mikey's trite home armed with a federal search warrant. There were six of us."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54981db5-6390-4446-b7db-209d00918c63",
                                                "sense_id": "b0352eab-e1e1-3665-9818-1e66905bef6e",
                                                "text": "They were different in many ways but what was it about opposites attracting... […] She was his opposite, but not his nemesis, and they worked well together. She hoped he liked working with her."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a365b79-308b-4969-8eb8-817931652263",
                                                "sense_id": "b0352eab-e1e1-3665-9818-1e66905bef6e",
                                                "text": "Jack took many hits to his body from his nemesis, but to his surprise he barely felt it. Jack's nemesis looked at him with anger in his eyes, clinching his fist to throw the next blow and without hesitation he threw another punch[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98d7ae24-1c65-49fe-8ab0-aba8a8d7e73a",
                                                "sense_id": "b0352eab-e1e1-3665-9818-1e66905bef6e",
                                                "text": "Along the way, they meet Master Wong, who teaches them kung fu and imparts nuggets of Chinese philosophy, knowledge and training that they eventually use to defeat their nemesis and save their village."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6faee46-edc4-3291-a05c-b7735f40d0e4",
                                        "entry_id": "adca1849-d2bb-33d9-aa4b-d9071f8eb8fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person or character who specifically brings about the downfall of another person or character, as an agent of that character's fate or destiny, especially within a narrative."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d77b378-6b77-3b81-af5d-dd91a53202a5",
                                        "entry_id": "adca1849-d2bb-33d9-aa4b-d9071f8eb8fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The personification of the \\\"fatal flaw\\\" of a dramatic hero in the style of Greek tragedy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65d96df4-e91a-32a8-a2fc-d9b4deef87e1",
                                        "entry_id": "adca1849-d2bb-33d9-aa4b-d9071f8eb8fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Polar opposite, especially of a literary character."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7aee3778-ed85-4673-bd73-18bf1e87d428",
                                                "sense_id": "65d96df4-e91a-32a8-a2fc-d9b4deef87e1",
                                                "text": "“And then, while he's devouring you with his stare, thinking about how much he wants to lick you up, along comes his antithesis, his polar opposite, his nemesis for want of a better word—” “Nemesis?” I interrupted, eyebrows journeying up my forehead. “—who swoops you off your feet and away from him,” Heather continued, ignoring my incredulous expression."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1517e8c3-dcec-3e71-9434-3b0444d32951",
                                        "entry_id": "adca1849-d2bb-33d9-aa4b-d9071f8eb8fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The principle of retributive justice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a1206851-b003-347f-bde8-cdeb5718c0a3",
                                        "entry_id": "adca1849-d2bb-33d9-aa4b-d9071f8eb8fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A punishment or defeat that is deserved and cannot be avoided; (an instance of) retribution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "formal",
                                            "singular",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2af01840-0b50-495a-a44f-d7746a61fd05",
                                                "sense_id": "a1206851-b003-347f-bde8-cdeb5718c0a3",
                                                "text": "Even Nathan's close associates, who are not yet ready to declare themselves his enemies, accept that his engineered downfall will be his nemesis for harbouring ambitions beyond his status, and do nothing to alert him to the situation[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
